== S4. THE LIMITS — where does the comb lose the shape? ==
Sweeping the ceiling at fixed strong shear: the outermost rung
caps the axis ratio, so the comb span IS the aspect-ratio bound.
 ceiling  nrungs   a:b at t=6   max rung ratio   locked?
       1       3        2.0048             2.0   NO  (off 3.5e-03)
       2       7        4.0096             4.0   NO  (off 3.5e-03)
       3      17        8.0192             8.0   NO  (off 3.5e-03)
       4      41       16.0385            16.0   NO  (off 3.5e-03)
       5      93       32.0770            32.0   NO  (off 3.5e-03)
       6     211       64.1539            64.0   NO  (off 3.5e-03)
       7     477      128.3079           128.0   NO  (off 3.5e-03)

reading: a:b saturating at the outermost rung means the comb span
sets the maximum aspect ratio — a bound on SHAPE made of
intervals, with no length anywhere. That is the bound the size
story could not deliver.
